# f8 swaps kanagawa reading colours in and out.
#
# toggle_custom_color = the custom_background_color / custom_text_color path (see prefs_user.config)
# toggle_dark_mode    = the colour-invert path, shipped on f8 in the bundled keys.config
#
# f8 itself does not reach here: sioyek's macOS menu bar has F8 on Help > Donate
# and AppKit matches menu key equivalents first. ~/.hammerspoon/sioyek_f8.lua
# swallows F8 while sioyek is frontmost and presses View > Toggle custom color
# mode for us, so the binding below is documentation rather than the mechanism.
toggle_custom_color <f8>
#toggle_dark_mode <f7>